IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `sd-rules`

-- Statutory Declarations Act 1959 (Cth) — the encoder's tests.

§ `Tests`

`witnessed` MEANS `signed under the observation of a prescribed person`
`online` MEANS `completed and signed on an approved online platform`
`cth law` MEANS `for the purposes of, or a matter under, a Commonwealth or Territory law`

GIVEN h IS A `How made`, o IS A `Observation`, signedorig IS A BOOLEAN, signedcopy IS A BOOLEAN, u IS A `Use`
GIVETH A `Declaration case`
`made` h `observed` o `witness signed` signedorig `copy signed` signedcopy `for` u MEANS
    `Declaration case` OF TRUE, h, `by hand on a physical form`, TRUE, TRUE, o, signedorig, signedcopy, TRUE, TRUE, u, FALSE, FALSE

-- s 9: in person, signed by the prescribed person.
#ASSERT `it is validly made` (`made` `witnessed` `observed` `in person` `witness signed` TRUE `copy signed` FALSE `for` `cth law`)
#ASSERT NOT (`it is validly made` (`made` `witnessed` `observed` `in person` `witness signed` FALSE `copy signed` FALSE `for` `cth law`))
-- s 9(c)(ii): by video link, the true copy signed.
#ASSERT `it is validly made` (`made` `witnessed` `observed` `by video link` `witness signed` FALSE `copy signed` TRUE `for` `cth law`)
#ASSERT NOT (`it is validly made` (`made` `witnessed` `observed` `in person` `witness signed` FALSE `copy signed` TRUE `for` `cth law`))
-- s 9A
#ASSERT `it is validly made` (`made` `online` `observed` `in person` `witness signed` FALSE `copy signed` FALSE `for` `cth law`)
#ASSERT NOT (`it is validly made` (`Declaration case` OF TRUE, `online`, `by electronic means on an electronic form`, TRUE, TRUE, `in person`, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, `cth law`, FALSE, FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`it is validly made` (`made` `neither` `observed` `in person` `witness signed` TRUE `copy signed` FALSE `for` `cth law`))
-- s 9(a): not in the approved form
#ASSERT NOT (`it is validly made` (`Declaration case` OF FALSE, `witnessed`, `by hand on a physical form`, TRUE, TRUE, `in person`, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, `cth law`, FALSE, FALSE))
-- s 7A: an unreliable method
#ASSERT NOT (`it is validly made` (`Declaration case` OF TRUE, `witnessed`, `by electronic means on an electronic form`, TRUE, FALSE, `in person`, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, `cth law`, FALSE, FALSE))
-- s 6
#ASSERT `does the Act authorise the use for` (`made` `witnessed` `observed` `in person` `witness signed` TRUE `copy signed` FALSE `for` `cth law`) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `does the Act authorise the use for` (`Declaration case` OF TRUE, `witnessed`, `by hand on a physical form`, TRUE, TRUE, `in person`, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, `cth law`, TRUE, FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `does the Act authorise the use for` (`made` `witnessed` `observed` `in person` `witness signed` TRUE `copy signed` FALSE `for` `in the administration of a Commonwealth Department`) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `does the Act authorise the use for` (`made` `witnessed` `observed` `in person` `witness signed` TRUE `copy signed` FALSE `for` `as evidence in a judicial proceeding`) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- s 11
#ASSERT (`the declaration position for` (`Declaration case` OF TRUE, `witnessed`, `by hand on a physical form`, TRUE, TRUE, `in person`, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, `cth law`, FALSE, TRUE))'s `maximum imprisonment in years` EQUALS 4
#ASSERT NOT (`I commit an offence` (`made` `witnessed` `observed` `in person` `witness signed` TRUE `copy signed` FALSE `for` `cth law`))
